@startuml "Memento - Game (Solution) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title The player makes its checkpoint; the game keeps it
class Player <<Originator>> {
  - health : int
  - position : String
  - inventory : List<String>
  + save() : Checkpoint
  + load(Checkpoint)
}
class "Player.Checkpoint" as C <<Memento>> {
  - health : int
  - position : String
  - inventory : List<String>
}
class Game <<Caretaker>> {
  - checkpoints : Deque<Checkpoint>
  + checkpoint(Player)
  + loadLatest(Player)
}
Player ..> C : creates, reads
Game o--> "*" C : keeps
Game --> Player
note bottom of C
  <b>Private fields, no getters.</b>
  The game keeps it, but cannot read it.
end note
@enduml
